WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.350
Air Traffic Control for Nova, from Swipht Group.

00:03.350 --> 00:14.350
It runs coding agents right in Nova: Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Antigravity, OpenCode, Pi, JetBrains Junie, and Grok.

00:14.350 --> 00:16.870
Write a flight plan, and take off.

00:16.870 --> 00:22.080
Each flight works in its own Git worktree, and you follow it in a live transcript.

00:22.080 --> 00:28.610
When it lands, review the diff, write a comment right in it, and send it back to the same agent session.

00:28.610 --> 00:34.290
Race several agents, or several sessions of one, and let another agent judge the results.

00:34.290 --> 00:36.020
Then merge the winner.

00:36.020 --> 00:40.510
It needs Nova 11 or later, and at least one agent CLI.

00:40.510 --> 00:44.240
Find Air Traffic Control in the Nova Extension Library.
